ng around and causing chaos, there's always something to do in Fear Reality.\n\nFear Reality  face your fear.", "short_description": "Fear Reality is a multiplayer VR horror game where you never know what\u2019s waiting around the corner. Explore creepy maps, and try to survive monsters like Teethling and Splitface."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fearrealitywebsite/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "OVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fearrealitywebsite/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1374951909037182"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619059_1606524597865279_377250146398069511_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5QCL6WpJfxUQ7kNvwGS8Ltv&_nc_oc=AdpeHHsGxEyD8OJ3dR4CCo3nlkhOikzJZ6XsIBZsgbWzLODo1jF5XFny_xSJ1bHwwYQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQT1dQ2_oGzjFZv4wEawo3rss_AVZgk_lt77a0gM-Pmfg&oe=6AFB2AC8"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Fear Reality", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"contex